# Salesperson Who Did Not Have Orders With RED Company

## Problem Summary
Write a query to find the names of salespeople who did not have any orders with the company named `RED`.

## Solution

```sql
SELECT name FROM Salesperson
WHERE sales_id NOT IN (
    SELECT sales_id FROM Orders
    WHERE com_id = (
        SELECT com_id FROM Company
        WHERE name = 'RED'
    )
);
```
